Provenance of the fixtures under tests/fixtures/qpdf/
=====================================================

These PDFs are NOT copied from QPDF's `qtest/` suite. They are *generated* by
the QPDF command-line tool (`qpdf --encrypt`, `--object-streams=generate`,
`--linearize`, …) from a small in-repo base document, by
`tests/scripts/gen-qpdf-fixtures.ts`. QPDF is used here as a well-tested
*producer* whose output better-pdf must read correctly — the same role qpdf
already plays as a *validator* in tests/qpdf-validate.test.ts.

The generator and the behavioral expectations were designed by reading QPDF's
public test suite for the shapes it exercises (encryption R2–R6, object/xref
streams, linearization, xref reconstruction). No QPDF source or fixture bytes
are redistributed here.

